{"base_rate":0.2457293035479632,"brier":0.11186373193166885,"bss":0.3964613063407182,"bss_hi":0.48091914199709246,"bss_lo":0.31542590118573777,"chart":{"base":[380.6,127.4],"fp":[238.5,268.3],"lead":"62,242.4 272,198.6 482,161.7 692,96","note":{"base":"skill 0.40 — higher than 68% of cities","fp":"low end +5pp, high end +15pp","lead":"day-1 error 1.2 °C — better than 46% of cities","rel":"promised 1% → rained 5%; promised 87% → rained 73%"},"rel":"68,443.3 239.4,326.9 610.7,148.8"},"country":"RO","deep":false,"depth":["Rain-probability calibration","Calibration curve","Seasonal split"],"ece":0.061957950065703066,"ess":424.70198194006184,"html":{"answer":"\n<h2 id=\"answer\">The short answer for Craiova</h2>\n<div class=\"verdict\">\n<p class=\"lead\"><b>The Craiova rain forecast is genuinely useful, though 4 points on its probability scale are off by more than chance explains.</b></p>\n<p>When it says rain is <i>near certain</i> (99%), believe about\n<b>86%</b>. When it says rain is <i>very unlikely</i>\n(0%), there is still roughly a <b>3%</b> chance.</p>\n<p class=\"muted\">Based on 761 days, 2024-04-26 to\n2026-05-30. \"Rain\" means at least 0.2 mm measured at\nCRAIOVA, 11.1 km from the forecast grid point.\nSkill score 0.40, ranked 43 of\n134 &mdash; but see the rank <i>range</i>\n(20&ndash;70) before reading anything into\nthat position.</p>\n</div>\n\n<h3>What the percentages actually mean here</h3>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th class=\"num\">It said</th><th class=\"num\">It rained</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Days</th><th>Verdict</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td class='num'>0%</td><td class='num'><b>3%</b></td><td class='num'>358</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>4%</td><td class='num'><b>13%</b></td><td class='num'>99</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">underpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>16%</td><td class='num'><b>20%</b></td><td class='num'>70</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>39%</td><td class='num'><b>43%</b></td><td class='num'>76</td><td><span class=\"tag good\">honest</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>75%</td><td class='num'><b>61%</b></td><td class='num'>79</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr><tr><td class='num'>99%</td><td class='num'><b>86%</b></td><td class='num'>79</td><td><span class=\"tag bad\">overpromised</span></td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">4 of 6 groups are further from honest than chance\nalone can explain. The rest are indistinguishable from a perfect forecast.</p>\n","card":"\n<div class=\"gcard\">\n  <p class=\"gcard-head\"><b>Craiova</b> <span class=\"muted\">RO</span></p>\n  <p class=\"gcard-tier\"><span class=\"tag good\">Genuinely useful</span>\n    <span class=\"muted\">4 points off by more than chance</span></p>\n  <dl class=\"gcard-stats\">\n    <div><dt>Skill score</dt><dd>0.40</dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Rank</dt><dd>20&ndash;70\n      <span class=\"muted\">of 134</span></dd></div>\n    <div><dt>Record</dt><dd>761 <span class=\"muted\">days</span></dd></div>\n  </dl>\n  <p class=\"gcard-more\"><a href=\"#answer\">The full verdict for\n    Craiova &darr;</a></p>\n</div>","curve":"\n<h2 id=\"curve\">The calibration curve</h2>\n<p>Each dot is a group of days sharing a similar forecast. Horizontal position\nis what was promised; vertical is what happened. <b>On the dashed diagonal =\nhonest.</b> Hover any dot for its sample size.</p>\n<figure><svg viewBox=\"0 0 430 430\" width=\"100%\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"Calibration curve for Craiova\"><rect class=\"chart-plot\" x=\"58\" y=\"18\" width=\"354\" height=\"364\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"58\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"382\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"58\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">0%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"386\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">0%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"146.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"146.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"291.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"291.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"146.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">25%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"295.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">25%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"235.0\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"235.0\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"200.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"200.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">50%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"204.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">50%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"323.5\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"323.5\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"109.0\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"109.0\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"323.5\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">75%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"113.0\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">75%</text><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"412\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><line class=\"chart-grid\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"18\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\"/><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"412\" y=\"399\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"middle\">100%</text><text class=\"chart-axis\" x=\"49\" y=\"22\" font-size=\"11\" text-anchor=\"end\">100%</text><polygon class=\"chart-band\" points=\"58.00988826815642,382.0 73.51878787878788,348.9090909090909 116.00542857142858,288.4 196.06,195.21052631578945 324.35139240506334,77.8987341772152 408.280759493671,18.0 408.280759493671,31.822784810126564 324.35139240506334,142.40506329113924 196.06,276.63157894736844 116.00542857142858,350.8 73.51878787878788,378.32323232323233 58.00988826815642,382.0\" opacity=\"0.16\"/><line class=\"chart-ideal\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"382\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"18\" stroke-dasharray=\"5,4\" stroke-width=\"1.3\"/><line class=\"chart-base\" x1=\"58\" y1=\"292.5545335085414\" x2=\"412\" y2=\"292.5545335085414\" stroke-dasharray=\"2,3\"/><polyline class=\"chart-line\" points=\"58.00988826815642,370.81564245810057 73.51878787878788,334.2020202020202 116.00542857142858,309.2 196.06,223.94736842105263 324.35139240506334,160.83544303797467 408.280759493671,68.68354430379748\" fill=\"none\" stroke-width=\"2.4\"/><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 0%&amp;#10;It rained 3% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 358 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"58.00988826815642\" cy=\"370.81564245810057\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 4%&amp;#10;It rained 13% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 99 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"73.51878787878788\" cy=\"334.2020202020202\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 16%&amp;#10;It rained 20% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 70 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"116.00542857142858\" cy=\"309.2\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 39%&amp;#10;It rained 43% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 76 days&amp;#10;within the range a perfect forecast would give\"><circle class=\"chart-dot\" cx=\"196.06\" cy=\"223.94736842105263\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 75%&amp;#10;It rained 61% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 79 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"324.35139240506334\" cy=\"160.83544303797467\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><g class=\"pt\" data-tip=\"Forecast said 99%&amp;#10;It rained 86% of the time&amp;#10;Based on 79 days&amp;#10;outside the perfect-forecast range - real miscalibration\"><circle class=\"chart-dot sig\" cx=\"408.280759493671\" cy=\"68.68354430379748\" r=\"6.5\" stroke-width=\"2\"/></g><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"235.0\" y=\"422\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\">What the forecast promised</text><text class=\"chart-label\" x=\"15\" y=\"200.0\" font-size=\"12.5\" text-anchor=\"middle\" transform=\"rotate(-90 15 200.0)\">How often it actually rained</text></svg>\n<figcaption>Green band = where a <b>flawless</b> forecast would still land, given\nhow few days we have. Red dots fall outside it, so those are real errors rather\nthan noise. The faint horizontal line is climatology\n(25%).</figcaption></figure>\n","season":"\n<h2 id=\"season\">Does the season matter?</h2>\n<p>In Craiova the forecast is most skilful in\n<b>autumn</b> (0.42) and least in\n<b>summer</b> (0.25).</p>\n<div class=\"tablewrap\">\n<table><thead><tr><th>Season</th><th class=\"num\">Days</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Rain days</th><th class=\"num\">Skill score</th>\n<th class=\"num\">Avg error</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>summer</td><td class='num'>184</td><td class='num'>14%</td><td class='num'>0.253</td><td class='num'>3.5%</td></tr><tr><td>spring</td><td class='num'>217</td><td class='num'>25%</td><td class='num'>0.387</td><td class='num'>5.9%</td></tr><tr><td>winter</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>30%</td><td class='num'>0.417</td><td class='num'>9.8%</td></tr><tr><td>autumn</td><td class='num'>180</td><td class='num'>29%</td><td class='num'>0.417</td><td class='num'>8.8%</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<p class=\"muted\">Four-way splits of a two-year record are thin, so read the\nordering as indicative. Coarser binning is used here than for the annual curve\nfor the same reason.</p>\n"},"lat":44.31667,"lon":23.8,"n":761,"n_cities":134,"name":"Craiova","offset_days":-1,"pop_map":[{"hi":0.03,"lo":0.0,"mean":2.793296089385475e-05,"n":358,"obs":0.030726256983240222,"sig":true},{"hi":0.08000000000000114,"lo":0.03,"mean":0.04383838383838384,"n":99,"obs":0.13131313131313133,"sig":true},{"hi":0.25,"lo":0.08000000000000114,"mean":0.16385714285714287,"n":70,"obs":0.2,"sig":false},{"hi":0.58,